| `src/lib/events/consumer-contract.ts` | The consumer-contract hash: the deployment-version barrier's signal, over the kind union plus every coverage manifest. |
| `src/lib/events/consumers/coverage.ts` | Per-consumer coverage manifests (`legacy \| shadow \| on \| none`, exhaustive over the union) and the declared inline writer behind every `legacy` entry. |
| `src/lib/events/consumers/dispatch.ts` | The shared dispatcher: manifest + effects to the drain-facing `handleEvent`, and the payload-narrowing helpers. |
| `src/lib/events/consumers/{notifications,activity-trail,memory-ingest}.ts` | The three consumers. |
| `src/lib/events/consumers/registry.ts` | Every consumer the drain runtime drives; registration is what activates one. |
